    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Delinks all prims in the link set.</p>
  <p>To run this function the script must request the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_CHANGE_LINKS" target="_blank">PERMISSION_CHANGE_LINKS</a> permission with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRequestPermissions" target="_blank">llRequestPermissions</a>&amp;#32;and it must be granted by the owner.</p>
</p>
